  "description": "Material 3 (Material You) for WPF: a runtime theme (ThemeManager) that generates the full M3 color-role scheme from one seed color (HCT) and publishes it as live DynamicResource brushes so the whole UI recolors on the fly, plus a set of themed M3 controls (filled/tonal/outlined/text buttons, icon button and icon toggle, FAB, filled and outlined text fields with a floating label, search bar, select, assist/filter/input/suggestion chips, tabs, badge, switch, radio, three-state checkbox, segmented button, slider, menus, plain and rich tooltips, scrollbar, linear and circular progress, card, list item, divider, expander, colour field, list and record editors, number input filter), a blocking M3 dialog, page furniture (PageHeader, NoticeBanner, EmptyState, PopupCard, Snackbar), elevation shadows and tinted surfaces, loading skeletons, the Busy spinner and a step checklist, an icon-set-agnostic PathIcon, and motion helpers. Built on Material3.Core.",
